make the same mistake, depth compounds fast. node_modules is hydrated
automatically when the worktree is created, so don't run `npm install` or
treat the worktree as having no deps. Keep the parallel phase network-quiet:
adding a NEW dependency needs the npm registry and will trip the egress gate,
so do dependency changes before/after fanning out, not during. Use the
