#   claude setup-token > ~/.claude-sandbox-x/oauth-token         # one-year token, no login inside
# The token file is exported as CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN for that tenant only.
# Skipped on seatbelt: macOS stores the token in the Keychain, not a
# .credentials.json file, so this check would false-warn on every run.
TENANT_TOKEN=""
